{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0233_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fae22d3d74567b2e4ae596db7aa76707245491fc42173c89fd51f91792464313", "ja": "（今日はアイドル強化合宿！　茜はかなり気合いが\n入っているみたいだ。きっと準備もバッチリ……）", "zh": "（今天是偶像强化集训！茜好像干劲十足。准备工作肯定也都做好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0233_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "0fa1e54fbf5ab4febcda07f1dd615d4df5b1b4b87ecf9b111cd615659f65c422", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、大変だよ～！\n茜ちゃん、大事なものを忘れてきちゃったよぉ～！", "zh": "{$P$}，出大事啦～！\n小茜把很重要的东西忘带来了哟～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0233_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f51e5d9642283b274cab811e775993a69a21c22980066140aa29fd2ecbda2ab9", "ja": "えっ！？　一体何を忘れたんだ？\n近くで調達できるものなら買ってくるけど……。", "zh": "诶！？到底忘了什么？\n要是能在附近买到的话，我去买回来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0233_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "d7d498b47b1e06d6e19417d4208c582921780097e4711888a44914852acf31de", "ja": "トランプだよ、トランプ！　\n合宿のために、わざわざ新しいの買ったのに……！", "zh": "是扑克牌啦，扑克牌！\n明明为了集训还特意买了副新的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0233_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ca6d830e57f4fd1dea6329ff585e127b517cee1788956d43a8342beefa6e7587", "ja": "……。\nなあ、茜。ちなみに、他には何を持ってきたんだ？", "zh": "……。\n话说茜，顺便问一下，你还带了什么别的过来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0233_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "532eae72515ebca7ac386cef1b7f79d6203b7a86ff2bb815fdaa735f39a21d40", "ja": "にゃ？　えっとね……カルタとすごろくと、\n携帯ゲーム機と充電器。あとは……。", "zh": "喵？呃……歌牌和双六，还有掌上游戏机和充电器。然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0233_1006_p", "source_sha256": "320ab738c754fdc588930985f94e0135486e162c734a80370225b101ca722337", "ja": "遊ぶ気満々じゃないか！", "zh": "你这不是已经完全准备好玩了吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0233_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "774d495ea9f1b174efa4786ec2cb91974e841daf3c5766b99f9d28cab74aa68f", "ja": "ふっふっふっ。甘いね{$P$}ちゃん！\nこれは……大事なレッスン道具なのだよっ！", "zh": "呵呵呵。你太天真了，{$P$}！\n这可是……重要的训练道具哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0233_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "af44fc3c99f8dc05028ffae61653a90ec85b135ba6699e9b97500e7271cf7826", "ja": "いい？　この合宿の目的は、団結力の向上でしょ？\nつまり、友情を深めることが近道なのです。", "zh": "听好咯？这次合宿的目的，是为了提高团结力对吧？\n也就是说，加深友情才是捷径！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0233_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "29682673af426db53d02f1ce8ffc3c4ecfc21b27258946adf0900d58ecb87e10", "ja": "仲を深めるためにすることといえば……そう！\n『みんなで遊ぶこと！』ほら、レッスン道具でしょ？", "zh": "说到加深感情要做的事……没错！\n“就是大家一起玩！”你看，这不是练习用的道具吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0233_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7b935ff69d01ed6704a8af457b53ea081ce71f9a8bc17d36c65c917a71d73894", "ja": "でしょ？　じゃなくて。\n……まあ、一理あるような気がしなくもないけど。", "zh": "不是“对吧”吧。\n……不过，感觉也不是完全没有道理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0233_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "881d649935895cb2bd0423ec474ce8b9688f1e332289718cf94ec79e0331a203", "ja": "でしょでしょ？　みんなの仲が深まれば、\nライブのパフォーマンス向上も間違いなし！", "zh": "对吧对吧？只要大家的关系更加亲密，演唱会的表现力肯定也会提升！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0233_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "ab9701355b01bd4ff9cff586fdaa8c9d234d86e4a67211c59587c08bc91cca6b", "ja": "だからね、練習メニューにしっかり入れるべきだと\n茜ちゃんは思うんだけどなぁ……。……ちらっ。", "zh": "所以啊，我觉得应该把小茜好好安排进练习菜单里才对……。……瞟一眼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0233_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a6bdcffe0ba91759e6c039f00f984ec72ffb050185d36bd9c6e21d7f5c91b798", "ja": "わかったわかった。考えておくよ。", "zh": "知道了知道了。我会考虑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0233_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "34862377aff36eb4c919cdb06e54191156c36c31805fb7c915bf77e9402e0dfe", "ja": "ニャハッ☆　{$P$}ちゃんってば、\n茜ちゃんのこと、わかってるぅ～♪", "zh": "喵哈哈☆　{$P$}还真懂小茜呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0233_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f79af4c5508d5664912f9cd97fc1a7a43e769dfe99b50e2f8b1c65434e4cc34d", "ja": "遊ぶ時間を増やして、レッスンを逃れようと\nしてるのかと、ちょっと思ったけどな。", "zh": "我还稍微怀疑过，你是不是想增加玩乐时间，好逃避练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0233_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "62a03ca0c879048e640d25e2e4e13158a2b009a438ccfbf69232e294a52712f3", "ja": "ギクギクッ！？\nそ、そんなわけないじゃん？　イヤだなあ、あはは！", "zh": "咯、咯咯！？  \n才、才不是那样呢？真讨厌啊，啊哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0233_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "237ec80be8da642a4497742c95d68e3ac798f4e678e9be7e1978313454ac49f9", "ja": "あ、あーっ！　なんか茜ちゃんを呼ぶ声が聞こえる！\nもうこんな時間！　茜ちゃん行くね！　じゃあっ！", "zh": "啊、啊——！好像听到有人在叫小茜！\n都已经这个时间了！我得去小茜了！那就先走啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0233_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d0e871b1cee1a0c948c633a5a2f2208c21019cb5d68075e4215a61d9c672f617", "ja": "（どこにも時計なんかないが……まあいいや。\nせっかくの合宿、遊びもレッスンも全力で、だな！）", "zh": "（明明哪里都没有钟……不过算了。难得来参加合宿，玩也好训练也好，都要全力以赴，对吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
